# The shell's overlays at 320x480 (profile p320; study portrait-320, PR-F): the toast (one and two lines), the media OSD
# of the brightness / volume keys, mute, and the "Loading..." overlay take the computed (token) sizes of the narrow
# portrait display instead of the 320x170 numbers. Golden at 320x480 only.
title p320 overlays
sizes 320x480
profile p320
env APPLAUNCH_DEV 1
keyboards 0
apps Settings CLI SSH Calculator
clock 20:30
wifi 70
bt on
home
toast "Connected to Home Wi-Fi"
shot p320_toast_home
toast "Bluetooth keyboard connected\nM4 keyboard"
shot p320_toast_two_lines
toast off
osd level Brightness 60
shot p320_osd_brightness
osd level Volume 85
shot p320_osd_volume
osd mute on
shot p320_osd_mute
wait 1200
loading "Loading..."
shot p320_loading
loading off
